<title>USA: France wants early lira entry into ERM, French source says.</title>
<headline>France wants early lira entry into ERM, French source says.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>France is in favour of the lira joining the exchange rate mechanism of the European Monetary System quickly, and as soon as the necessary conditions are in place, a senior French source said Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are in favour of a quick entry of the lira into the ERM as soon as the right conditions are in place, at an appropriate level,&quot; the source, who declined to be further identified, said. He declined to say at what level the lira would re-join the mechanism.</p>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis met Italian Treasury Minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi on Sunday and the two are due to meet again at the end of this week at a Franco-Italian summit in Naples.</p>
</text>
